utine, although having a big advantage, more than 9.5 points, the duet from China made a number of mistakes, but held on for the gold medal. The duos from Great Britain and the Netherlands performed consistently, which allowed them to win the silver and bronze medals, respectively."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Pair"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Points"] [:th {} "Free Routine"] [:th {} "Technical Routine"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/154835"} "Wang Liuyi"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/141765"} "Wang Qianyi"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CHN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CHN.png"}] "CHN"]] [:td {} "566.4783"] [:td {} "289.6916 (4)"] [:td {} "276.7867 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/143070"} "Kate Shortman"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/143069"} "Isabelle Thorpe"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GBR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GBR.png"}] "GBR"]] [:td {} "558.5367"] [:td {} "294.5085 (1)"] [:td {} "267.2533 (4)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/145516"} "Bregje de Brouwer"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/145517"} "Noortje de Brouwer"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/NED"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/NED.png"}] "NED"]] [:td {} "558.3963"] [:td {} "293.6897 (2)"] [:td {} "264.7066 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/129104"} "Anna-Maria Alexandri"] " / " [:a {